gton_Nov5_2026_AM_76.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>9</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59667</s:story_id></item><item><title>Sadler Racks Up Big 12 Weekly Accolades</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/9/mens-basketball-sadler-racks-up-big-12-weekly-accolades</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/9/mens-basketball-sadler-racks-up-big-12-weekly-accolades</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Miles Sadler was named Big 12 Freshman of the Week & to Big 12 Starting 5" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/9/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_MilesNov9.jpg" /><br /><br />IRVING, Texas - BYU's Robert Wright III earned Player of the Week while West Virginia's Miles Sadler earned Freshman of the Week honors in the first Monster Energy Big 12 Men's Basketball weekly awards of the 2026-27 season.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_MilesNov9.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_MilesNov9.jpg"><media:title>Miles Sadler was named Big 12 Freshman of the Week &amp; to Big 12 Starting 5</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/9/MBB26_Big12WeeklyAward_1920x1080_MilesNov9.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:58:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59670</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>